-----WHERE CLAUSES-----
 where clause is used to filter the rows based on the condition.
   
- 1.Display all customers whose age is greater than 25
   select*from cust where age>25

-2.Display customers whose salary is greater than 50000.
   select *from cust where salary>50000

-3.Display customers who live in Hyderabad.
   select*from cust where city='Hyderabad'

-4.Display employees working in the IT department.
  select*from cust where department ='it'

-5.Display customers whose age is less than 30.
  select*from cust where age<30

-6.Display customers whose salary is less than 40000.
   select*from cust where salary <40000

-7.Display female customers.
